{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e15-scene-12",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "传媒学院论文答辩  (Thesis Defence at Media College)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "fang": "方老师",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At Media College, Bu Xiaogu steps into her master's thesis defence and discovers that Professor Fang has invited Chun Yuqiao onto the review panel. Listen to their Mandarin exchange.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "小谷同学，先来认识一下学位评委的各位教授。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "各位教授你们好，我是布小谷。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "还有著名电视节目制作人淳于乔先生，他是作为独立专家参与的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "写篇论文吧，就当是工作任务。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，我现在写论文干吗用呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在有个很好的机会，你可以跟今年的硕士一起提交论文。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "论文写完了吗？出发之前写完一稿，到了欧洲就没时间写了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我的论文题目叫制作人的孤岛，探讨当代中国电视艺术发展的困境与突围。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们一直说中国是文化大国，但是节目依然缺乏创新。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们拥有庞大的消费群体，却缺乏与之匹配的文化市场供应。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "我教了你们两年，你们中间没有一个人求我拍张照。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "方老师，您就认命吧！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "小谷同学，先来认识一下学位评委的各位教授。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, come meet the professors on the degree committee first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "各位教授你们好，我是布小谷。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, professors; I am Bu Xiaogu.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "还有著名电视节目制作人淳于乔先生，他是作为独立专家参与的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And renowned television producer Chun Yuqiao, who is serving as an independent expert.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "写篇论文吧，就当是工作任务。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Write a thesis—treat it as a work assignment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，我现在写论文干吗用呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chun Yuqiao, what use is writing a thesis for me now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在有个很好的机会，你可以跟今年的硕士一起提交论文。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is a great opportunity right now for you to submit your thesis alongside this year's master's candidates.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "论文写完了吗？出发之前写完一稿，到了欧洲就没时间写了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have you finished the thesis? Finish a draft before departure, or you would have no time in Europe.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我的论文题目叫制作人的孤岛，探讨当代中国电视艺术发展的困境与突围。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My thesis is titled The Producer's Island, exploring the dilemmas and breakthroughs of contemporary Chinese television.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们一直说中国是文化大国，但是节目依然缺乏创新。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We always say our country has a rich culture, yet shows still lack innovation.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们拥有庞大的消费群体，却缺乏与之匹配的文化市场供应。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We have an enormous audience base, yet lack matching cultural market supply.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "我教了你们两年，你们中间没有一个人求我拍张照。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I taught you all for two years, and not a single one of you ever begged me for a photo.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "方老师，您就认命吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Professor Fang, just accept your fate!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "小谷同学，先来认识一下学位评委的各位教授。",
      "gap": 0.5
